S122's identity plants, 2026-11-02, over S122_research_prototype.patch and never committed
to src/: S122_PLANT picks one defect at run time, at the scored probe w 48, so that one build
reads what tools/truncation_scan and tools/eval_spread each catch (DEC-344 (5)). It also exports
the prototype loop's counts for S122_cmp_units.cpp. `S122_census.sh plants` applies and runs it.

